{"unit_id":"lishize20040802-rgb__dsh-deep-ptc-mode#card-zh","repo":"lishize20040802-rgb/dsh-deep-ptc-mode","commit":"38c4fc6cacb1dcd4530d6e0d5bb4451da47aa363","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Deep PTC mode（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：一个从当前官方 PTC 预设派生的 agent 工作模式，让插件生态中的工具能够按任务协作，并在官方能力不可用时保留回退。它会按宿主平台配置执行环境，提供 WSL、PowerShell、Zsh 或 Bash 选择，并为官方后台任务和提问流程加入可响应用户消息的等待机制。预设还包含工具兼容性处理与可达性约束，帮助长任务保持可管理。适合希望扩展 DSH PTC 工作方式、组合多种工具并继续使用官方能力的用户。运行需要 Node.js 24 及以上和 DSH 0.2.2-rc.1 及以上；没有额外 API 密钥配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:39-100","lib/model.mjs:18-55","lib/terminal.mjs:8-24"]}
{"unit_id":"lishize20040802-rgb__dsh-deep-ptc-mode#card-en","repo":"lishize20040802-rgb/dsh-deep-ptc-mode","commit":"38c4fc6cacb1dcd4530d6e0d5bb4451da47aa363","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Deep PTC mode is a DSH Web agent preset that follows the host PTC composition and lets external plugins contribute tools while keeping official fallbacks. Choose WSL, PowerShell, Zsh, or Bash for new sessions. Job and question waits respond to user messages. Requires Node.js 24+ and DSH 0.2.2-rc.1+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:39-100","lib/model.mjs:18-55","lib/terminal.mjs:8-24"]}
