{"unit_id":"lishize20040802-rgb__dsh-deep-ptc-mode#feature-1","repo":"lishize20040802-rgb/dsh-deep-ptc-mode","commit":"38c4fc6cacb1dcd4530d6e0d5bb4451da47aa363","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Deep PTC mode 的动态预设功能：启动时读取宿主当前的 PTC 声明并派生 agent 预设；官方声明变化或插件设置更新时刷新新预设代次，解析失败则使用内置快照回退。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:39-100","lib/model.mjs:150-245"]}
