{"unit_id":"lishize20040802-rgb__dsh-deep-ptc-mode#feature-3","repo":"lishize20040802-rgb/dsh-deep-ptc-mode","commit":"38c4fc6cacb1dcd4530d6e0d5bb4451da47aa363","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Deep PTC mode 的可中断等待功能：包装官方后台任务和提问流程，等待输出或回答期间监听用户消息，让等待能够提前结束并继续处理新消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/jobs-tool.mjs:8-20","lib/ask-user.mjs:8-20"]}
{"unit_id":"lishize20040802-rgb__dsh-deep-ptc-mode#feature-4","repo":"lishize20040802-rgb/dsh-deep-ptc-mode","commit":"38c4fc6cacb1dcd4530d6e0d5bb4451da47aa363","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Deep PTC mode 的可达性约束功能：向工具注册 guard，并把前台等待秒数、提问时限和每段程序的轮询次数作为配置，向预设加入对应的工作规则。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/guard.mjs:6-16"]}
